{
  "name": "REST API with Webhook, Switch and Respond to Webhook",
  "meta": {
    "description": "A tiny REST API in four nodes: a POST webhook checks the request with IF, routes it with Switch (create, get, delete) and answers with a different HTTP status code (201, 200, 204, 422, 400) using Respond to Webhook nodes.",
    "categories": [
      "Webhooks",
      "Utilities"
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "hook",
      "name": "API endpoint",
      "type": "flowforge.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "flowforge-api",
        "responseMode": "responseNode"
      },
      "webhookId": "rest-api-example"
    },
    {
      "id": "valid",
      "name": "Has an action?",
      "type": "flowforge.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.action }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "route",
      "name": "Route by action",
      "type": "flowforge.switch",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        540,
        -120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.action }}",
                    "rightValue": "create",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "create"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.action }}",
                    "rightValue": "get",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "get"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.action }}",
                    "rightValue": "delete",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "delete"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "created",
      "name": "201 Created",
      "type": "flowforge.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        840,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={ \"created\": true, \"item\": {{ JSON.stringify($('API endpoint').item.json.body.item ?? null) }} }",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 201
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "got",
      "name": "200 Item",
      "type": "flowforge.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        840,
        -150
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={ \"id\": \"{{ $('API endpoint').item.json.body.id ?? 1 }}\", \"name\": \"Sample item\", \"servedAt\": \"{{ $now.toISO() }}\" }",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200,
          "responseHeaders": [
            {
              "name": "X-Powered-By",
              "value": "FlowForge"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "deleted",
      "name": "204 Deleted",
      "type": "flowforge.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        840,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "noData",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 204
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "unknown",
      "name": "422 Unknown action",
      "type": "flowforge.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        840,
        150
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={ \"error\": \"Unknown action\", \"allowed\": [\"create\", \"get\", \"delete\"] }",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 422
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bad",
      "name": "400 Missing action",
      "type": "flowforge.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        540,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "{ \"error\": \"Send a JSON body with an action field\" }",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 400
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note",
      "name": "How to use",
      "type": "flowforge.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## REST API with a webhook\n1. Activate the workflow (toggle at the top).\n2. Open the Webhook node and copy the **Production URL**.\n3. Try it:\n`curl -X POST <url> -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{\"action\":\"create\",\"item\":{\"name\":\"Book\"}}'` answers **201**.\n`get` answers 200, `delete` answers 204, another action 422, no action 400.\nThe IF node checks the request, the Switch picks the route, each **Respond to Webhook** node sets its own status code."
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "API endpoint": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Has an action?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Has an action?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Route by action",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "400 Missing action",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Route by action": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "201 Created",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "200 Item",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "204 Deleted",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "422 Unknown action",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}
